{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "bc4b2ed5-02ad-4b2a-aa3d-0d3d908f6c51"/*_SurfaceContent3d*/,
  "Description": "Template for the output setup's Connect... → New 3D Content; not an operator to use.\n\nConnect... copies these children into the open composition, points every surface input at the selected surface and every output input at the projector: [SurfaceGeometry] → [GeometryToMesh] → [DrawMeshUnlit] textured by [SurfaceReferenceImage], into a [Group] rendered through [UseProjectorCam] → [RenderTarget] cleared transparent → [SendToOutput] with Resolution From: Output. The send then fills the output as its front layer. Edit the chain here to change what New 3D Content builds.",
